MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

clearPreservedForDialog called deleteForAccount: clearing one chat
deleted every other chat's deferred rows. Fix: drop each dialog ref
then release its deferred rows per-ref (account-scoped
getPendingForRef, refId==0 guard); same release added to
onDialogDeleted / onDialogClearedExcept / onChannelHistoryCleared,
which previously never released at all (rows orphaned until restart).
recordDeferredDelete now validates the refId against the durable row
(the path mirror is cross-account, so a foreign refId degrades to 0
instead of being stored). Startup sweep uses account-scoped
getPendingForAccount + the shared releaseDeferredRow helper.
New DAO primitives: deleteByAccountAndDialog (subquery via
refId -> PreservedRef.dialogId; refId==0 rows never matched),
deleteForRef, getPendingForDialog, getPendingForAccount.
deleteForAccount stays, only for purgeAccount/clearPreservedStorage.
Scenario 8 of AliGramRoomIntegrationTest now calls
deleteByAccountAndDialog (assertions unchanged); new
AliGramDeferredDeleteScopeTest covers the new DAO surface.
